      "description": "<p>The sage studies a creature, attempting an arcana, nature, occultism, religion, or society check against the creature's Recall Knowledge DC. On a success, the sage gains a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and AC against that creature and deals an additional 2d6 damage to the creature with weapon attacks.</p>\n<p>These benefits last for 1 minute or until the sage uses this ability again.</p>\n<p>Effect: Sage's Analysis</p>",
